<h2>Business Model</h2>
<p>Chumpol Trading Group operates exclusively as a <strong>B2B wholesale distributor</strong>. The company does not sell to end consumers.</p>
<p>As a pure B2B business, consumer-style reviews on platforms like Trustpilot or Google are <strong>not applicable</strong> and are not generated. The absence of consumer reviews is a structural feature of the wholesale business model.</p>
<p>Performance feedback is handled directly between contractual partners through established compliance and escalation processes.</p>

